# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the fuzz harnesses (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>).
# A rule hides every leak with that function anywhere in its allocation stack.
# CGNS 4.5.2: cg_version (called by cg_open) returns CG_ERROR without freeing its node ids and
# node data. Remove once a fixed CGNS version is in use.
leak:^cg_version$
